## CQ-UI-01 | renamed items (hotbar name popup)
@group client
@commands JEI search each rename: Cheesy Fish Pasta (and canned, plated), Loaded Burger, Stackable Pancake, Bread with Jam, Coffee Pie and its slice, the three tobacco bundles
@pass new names show; no old name left
@fails a resource-pack zip beats the lang override
@from batches/r1101/c1_client.qb
> item replace entity @s hotbar.0 with brewinandchewin:cheesy_pasta
> item replace entity @s hotbar.1 with vintagedelight:deluxe_burger
> item replace entity @s hotbar.2 with supplementaries:pancake
> item replace entity @s hotbar.3 with fruitsdelight:jelly_bread
> item replace entity @s hotbar.4 with rusticdelight:coffee_cheesecake
> item replace entity @s hotbar.5 with the_dirty_stuff:tobacco_package
> item replace entity @s hotbar.6 with vintagedelight:cucumber_noodles
> item replace entity @s hotbar.7 with veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_cupcake
> item replace entity @s hotbar.8 with oceansdelight:elder_guardian_roll
key 9
key 1
shot cheesy_fish_pasta
key 2
shot loaded_burger
key 3
shot stackable_pancake
key 4
shot bread_with_jam
key 5
shot coffee_pie
key 6
shot tobacco_bundle
key 7
shot veggie_noodles
key 8
shot sweet_potato_muffin
key 9
shot elder_guardian_roll
look each shot shows the new name above the hotbar: Cheesy Fish Pasta, Loaded Burger, Stackable Pancake, Bread with Jam, Coffee Pie, a tobacco bundle, Veggie Noodles (green zucchini texture), Sweet Potato Muffin, Elder Guardian Roll. hand: JEI search for the canned and plated pasta, the Coffee Pie slice and the other two tobacco bundles

## CQ-UI-02 | Ender's Delight and Veggies Delight crop blocks show names in WTHIT
@group client
@commands look at Amberveils, Ethereal Saffron, Chorusflame and Void Pepper Sprout with WTHIT, and Veggies Delight crop blocks (broccoli, cauliflower, garlic, sweet potato, turnip, zucchini); hover the Ender's Delight dishes
@pass names, not keys
@fails ops lang route does not reach the member keys
@from batches/r1101/c1_client.qb
> tp @s 0 -55 68 180 20
sleep 3
> fill 0 -60 60 20 -60 60 minecraft:air
> setblock 0 -61 60 minecraft:farmland
> setblock 0 -60 60 veggiesdelight:broccoli_crop
> tp @s 0 -59 57 0 30
shot broccoli
> setblock 0 -60 60 veggiesdelight:cauliflower_crop
shot cauliflower
> setblock 0 -60 60 veggiesdelight:garlic_crop
shot garlic
> setblock 0 -60 60 veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_crop
shot sweet_potato
> setblock 0 -60 60 veggiesdelight:turnip_crop
shot turnip
> setblock 0 -60 60 veggiesdelight:zucchini_crop
shot zucchini
look WTHIT names, not translation keys, in each shot (an "Unknown block" chat error = crop id differs: read the id from the item_dict). hand: Amberveils, Ethereal Saffron, Chorusflame, Void Pepper Sprout the same way on end stone; hover the Ender's Delight dishes

## CQ-UI-03 | ghost pepper planting tooltip
@group client
@commands ghost pepper tooltip
@pass "Requires a soul soil and the heat of the nether to grow"
@fails old soils line
@from batches/r1101/c1_client.qb
> item replace entity @s hotbar.0 with vintagedelight:ghost_pepper_seeds
look hand: open the inventory, hover slot 1: "Requires a soul soil and the heat of the nether to grow"

## CQ-UI-04 | Kettle fluid bar 3 px, centered (screen and JEI)
@group client
@commands needs the creativeDelight jar installed: open a Kettle with tea, the JEI Kettle page
@pass bar is 3 px wide, centered in its old 5 px slot; hover tooltip matches
@fails bar off-center or tooltip gap
@from batches/r1101/c1_client.qb
> tp @s 3 -55 5 180 20
sleep 3
> setblock 3 -60 -3 farmersrespite:kettle
look hand: put water and tea leaves in the Kettle, open it, screenshot with the bar at GUI scale 2; JEI Kettle page: bar 3 px wide centred in the old 5 px slot, tooltip hover matches
